{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-page-js","path":"/stringify/options/relax_quotes/","result":{"data":{"page":{"html":"<h1 id=\"option-code-classlanguage-textrelax_quotescode\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#option-code-classlanguage-textrelax_quotescode\" aria-label=\"option code classlanguage textrelax_quotescode permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Option <code class=\"language-text\">relax_quotes</code></h1>\n<p>Preserve the quote characters found inside a field without quoting it, as long as nothing else requires quotes.</p>\n<p>By default, a field containing a quote character is surrounded by quotes and its interior quotes are escaped, for example <code class=\"language-text\">say \"hi\"</code> is written as <code class=\"language-text\">\"say \"\"hi\"\"\"</code>. It is aligned with RFC 4180, section 2, rule 5, which states “If fields are not enclosed with double quotes, then double quotes may not appear inside the fields.”. With <code class=\"language-text\">relax_quotes</code>, the field is written as is, <code class=\"language-text\">say \"hi\"</code>.</p>\n<p>Quoting is still applied when it is required to preserve the structure of the record:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the field contains a delimiter;</li>\n<li>the field contains a record delimiter;</li>\n<li>the field starts with a quote character, leading whitespaces being ignored, otherwise it would be read back as a quoted field.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The option does not disable explicit quoting. The <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted_string/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted_string</code></a> and <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted_match/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted_match</code></a> options still quote the fields they select, and their interior quotes are escaped. It applies to custom and multi-character values of the <a href=\"/stringify/options/quote/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quote</code></a> option. It is also accepted as a field-level option returned by the <a href=\"/stringify/options/cast/\"><code class=\"language-text\">cast</code></a> functions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Type: <code class=\"language-text\">boolean</code></li>\n<li>Optional</li>\n<li>Default: <code class=\"language-text\">false</code></li>\n<li>Since: 6.10.0</li>\n<li>Related: <a href=\"/stringify/options/quote/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quote</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/escape/\"><code class=\"language-text\">escape</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted_match/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted_match</code></a>, <a href=\"/stringify/options/quoted_string/\"><code class=\"language-text\">quoted_string</code></a> — see <a href=\"/stringify/options/#available-options\">Available Options</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Note, the generated output does not comply with <a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180#section-2\">RFC 4180</a>, which forbids quotes inside unquoted fields. Parsers must be lenient to read it back, for example with the <a href=\"/parse/options/relax_quotes/\"><code class=\"language-text\">relax_quotes</code></a> option of the parser.</p>\n<h2 id=\"example\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#example\" aria-label=\"example permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Example</h2>\n<p>In the <a href=\"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv/blob/master/packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.relax_quotes.js\">relax quotes example</a>, the first field is written without quotes. The second field is quoted because it contain a delimiter. The last field is quoted because it starts with a quote character.</p>\n<p><div class=\"gatsby-highlight display-embed-file-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> assert <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"node:assert/strict\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> stringify <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"csv-stringify/sync\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'relax \"quotes\"'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"I,contain,delimiters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'\"I\"contain\"quotes\"'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">relax_quotes</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\nassert<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">equal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n  output<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token string\">'relax \"quotes\",\"I,contain,delimiters\",\"\"\"I\"\"contain\"\"quotes\"\"\"\\n'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre><div class=\"display-embed-file\"><a href=\"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv/blob/master/packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.relax_quotes.js\">./packages/csv-stringify/samples/option.relax_quotes.js</a></div></div></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Option relax_quotes","description":"Preserve quotes inside fields which do not require quoting.","keywords":["csv","stringify","options","relax_quotes","quote","escape"]},"headings":[{"id":"example","depth":2,"value":"Example"}],"fields":{"edit_url":"https://github.com/adaltas/node-csv-docs/edit/master/src/md/stringify/options/relax_quotes.md","slug":"/stringify/options/relax_quotes/"}}},"pageContext":{}},"staticQueryHashes":["421902736"],"slicesMap":{}}